cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MethylLlama: self-supervised foundation modelling of human DNA methylation profiles"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/netanelazran11/MethylLlama"
url: "https://huggingface.co/netanelazran1/MethylLlama"
abstract: >-
  MethylLlama is a Transformer encoder for human DNA methylation profiles, pretrained without phenotype
  labels on 169,120 array profiles with the Whole-CpG Encoder-Decoder (WCED) objective. This repository
  contains the model code, the scripts that produced every result of the manuscript, the result files and
  the exact software environment of those runs.
keywords:
  - DNA methylation
  - foundation model
  - self-supervised learning
  - Transformer
  - epigenetics
